 lazy map, so an algorithm that keeps an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iterator per vertex on its stack (Tarjan’s) allocates nothing for it."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ImplicitGraphs\/documentation\/ImplicitGraphs\/ImplicitDirectedGraph\/Successors","url":"\/documentation\/implicitgraphs\/implicitdirectedgraph\/successors"},"doc://ImplicitGraphs/s9EscapableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ImplicitGraphs\/s9EscapableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Escapable"}}}